      "updated": 1790849174848,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Brain order (cannot skip):  session  →  rate limit  →  firewall  →  keyword router (Gemini only if keywords miss)  →  lane\nLanes: refuse  ·  ask (missing detail)  ·  read  ·  write (one step)  ·  chain (≤8 steps)  ·  lever\n\nRead  —  “What's my health factor?”  MCP vanna_account.health → Gemini may reword numbers, never invent them.\nWrite —  “Supply 100 USDC”  MCP builds unsigned v0 tx + simulates → preview → wallet signs → lib/solana confirms.\nPlan  —  “Lever my SOL 2x”  server stores digest-bound steps (5 min). Each step: claim-once → fresh 1.15 check → rebuild → sign → confirm.",
      "originalText": "Brain order (cannot skip):  session  →  rate limit  →  firewall  →  keyword router (Gemini only if keywords miss)  →  lane\nLanes: refuse  ·  ask (missing detail)  ·  read  ·  write (one step)  ·  chain (≤8 steps)  ·  lever\n\nRead  —  “What's my health factor?”  MCP vanna_account.health → Gemini may reword numbers, never invent them.\nWrite —  “Supply 100 USDC”  MCP builds unsigned v0 tx + simulates → preview → wallet signs → lib/solana confirms.\nPlan  —  “Lever my SOL 2x”  server stores digest-bound steps (5 min). Each step: claim-once → fresh 1.15 check → rebuild → sign → confirm.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 81,
      "index": "ax"
    },
