      "type": "text",
      "text": "Not on this board (v1): Sign Service, auto-sign, Hermes, admin tools, liquidation execution, mainnet.\nSolana vs Stellar: same layers. Different signing (wallet only), login (SIWS), venues (Kamino + Jupiter), fork prices (keeper).",
